  "description": "Jin So-Un, a third-rate martial artist who remembers everything. He finds himself transported back to 30 years ago, before the Demon Sect’s return.\n\n The fact that I’ve returned to the past doesn’t exactly feel like a sign telling me to save the world. If that were the case, wouldn’t they have at least given me some special ability, or attached the spirit of Master Jang Sam-bong or something?\n\nThe Samun Sect, a third-rate martial arts school with no future. A talent for martial arts that couldn’t be more mediocre. My hand is simply too weak to feel any joy at having returned. \n\n *“I’m doomed.”*\n\nJin So-Un’s desperate struggle to change the despair of his predetermined future begins.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
